{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"looplj.AxonHub","latestVersion":"1.0.0-rc2","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"Copyright for portions of AxonHub are held by Sat Naing, 2026 as part of project [Shadcn Admin](https://github.com/satnaing/shadcn-admin). All other copyright for project AxonHub are held by looplj, 2026.","description":"A modern AI gateway system that provides a unified OpenAI (Chat Completion, Responses), Anthropic, Gemini and AI SDK compatible API","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"Copyright for portions of AxonHub are held by Sat Naing, 2026 as part of project [Shadcn Admin](https://github.com/satnaing/shadcn-admin). All other copyright for project AxonHub are held by looplj, 2026.","description":"A modern AI gateway system that provides a unified OpenAI (Chat Completion, Responses), Anthropic, Gemini and AI SDK compatible API","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"AxonHub is an all-in-one AI development platform that provides unified API gateway, project management, and comprehensive development tools. It offers OpenAI, Anthropic, and AI SDK compatible API layers, transforming requests to various AI providers through a transformer pipeline architecture. The platform features comprehensive tracing capabilities, project-based organization, and integrated playground for rapid prototyping, helping developers and enterprises better manage AI development workflows.\nCore Features:\n1. Unified API: OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible interface with automatic API translation lets you use one API format to access any supported model provider.\n2. Tracing / Threads: Thread-aware tracing captures full request timelines for deep observability and faster debugging.\n3. Fine-grained Permission: RBAC-based policies help teams govern access, usage, and data segregation precisely.\n4. Adaptive Load Balancing: Intelligent multi-strategy load balancing automatically selects optimal AI channels based on health, performance, and session consistency.","name":"AxonHub","packageUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub","publisher":"Loop","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/looplj","releaseNotes":"What's Changed\n- fix(responses): preserve tool output names without call IDs by @w568w in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2960\n- feat: introduce axonhub desktop by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2959\n- chore(deps): bump the npm-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 11 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2963\n- chore(deps-dev): bump globals from 16.5.0 to 17.14.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2965\n- chore(deps-dev): bump lint-staged from 15.5.2 to 17.6.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2964\n- chore(deps): bump @hookform/resolvers from 6.0.2 to 7.0.3 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2969\n- fix(plugin): stop syncing extracted plugin files by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2966\n- chore(deps): bump the shared-go-modules group across 2 directories with 9 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2968\n- chore(deps-dev): bump eslint from 9.39.4 to 10.14.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2967\n- docs: update demo URL and OpenRouter model information by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2971\n- feat(channels): preview model aliases and expose alias settings by @zhaozhaozz in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2859\n- fix(gemini): keep JSON Schema $ref in tool results as text by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2972\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/compare/v1.0.0-rc1...v1.0.0-rc2","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc2","tags":["ai","anthropic","artificial-intelligence","artificialintelligence","chatbot","google-gemini","large-language-model","llm","openai","proxy"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"一个现代化的 AI 网关系统，提供统一的 OpenAI（聊天补全、响应）、Anthropic、Gemini 和 AI SDK 兼容的 API","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"AxonHub 是一个 All-in-one AI 开发平台，提供统一的 API 网关、项目管理和全面的开发工具。平台提供 OpenAI、Anthropic 和 AI SDK 兼容的 API 层，通过转换器管道架构将请求转换到各种 AI 提供商。系统具备完整的追踪能力、基于项目的组织结构以及集成的 Playground 快速原型开发，帮助开发者和企业更好地管理 AI 开发工作流。\n核心特性：\n1. 统一 API Unified API：兼容 OpenAI 与 Anthropic 的接口，配合转换管线实现模型互换与映射，无需改动现有代码。\n2. 追踪 / 线程 Tracing / Threads：线程级追踪实时记录完整调用链路，提升可观测性与问题定位效率。\n3. 细粒度权限 Fine-grained Permission：基于 RBAC 的权限策略，帮助团队精细管理访问控制、配额与数据隔离。\n4. 自适应负载均衡 Adaptive Load Balancing: 智能多策略负载均衡，自动选择最优 AI 渠道，确保高可用性和最佳性能。","tags":["人工智能","代理","大语言模型","聊天机器人"]}},"longDescription":"AxonHub is an all-in-one AI development platform that provides unified API gateway, project management, and comprehensive development tools. It offers OpenAI, Anthropic, and AI SDK compatible API layers, transforming requests to various AI providers through a transformer pipeline architecture. The platform features comprehensive tracing capabilities, project-based organization, and integrated playground for rapid prototyping, helping developers and enterprises better manage AI development workflows.\nCore Features:\n1. Unified API: OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible interface with automatic API translation lets you use one API format to access any supported model provider.\n2. Tracing / Threads: Thread-aware tracing captures full request timelines for deep observability and faster debugging.\n3. Fine-grained Permission: RBAC-based policies help teams govern access, usage, and data segregation precisely.\n4. Adaptive Load Balancing: Intelligent multi-strategy load balancing automatically selects optimal AI channels based on health, performance, and session consistency.","name":"AxonHub","packageUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub","publisher":"Loop","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/looplj","releaseNotes":"What's Changed\n- fix(responses): preserve tool output names without call IDs by @w568w in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2960\n- feat: introduce axonhub desktop by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2959\n- chore(deps): bump the npm-minor-patch group across 1 directory with 11 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2963\n- chore(deps-dev): bump globals from 16.5.0 to 17.14.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2965\n- chore(deps-dev): bump lint-staged from 15.5.2 to 17.6.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2964\n- chore(deps): bump @hookform/resolvers from 6.0.2 to 7.0.3 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2969\n- fix(plugin): stop syncing extracted plugin files by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2966\n- chore(deps): bump the shared-go-modules group across 2 directories with 9 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2968\n- chore(deps-dev): bump eslint from 9.39.4 to 10.14.0 in /frontend by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2967\n- docs: update demo URL and OpenRouter model information by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2971\n- feat(channels): preview model aliases and expose alias settings by @zhaozhaozz in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2859\n- fix(gemini): keep JSON Schema $ref in tool results as text by @looplj in https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/pull/2972\nFull Changelog: https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/compare/v1.0.0-rc1...v1.0.0-rc2","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/looplj/axonhub/releases/tag/v1.0.0-rc2","tags":["ai","anthropic","artificial-intelligence"